    "notesEn": [
      "Traumatic brain injury severity by GCS (source, page 27): GCS >= 13 indicates mild injury; GCS 9-12 suggests moderate injury; GCS <= 8 is defined as severe traumatic brain injury.",
      "The detailed 4/5/6 scoring table does not appear in the source document; the standard Glasgow Coma Scale is provided here as supplementary reference.",
      "Total score range 3-15 (Eye 1-4 + Verbal 1-5 + Motor 1-6)."
    ],
    "notesZh": [
      "按 GCS 划分创伤性脑损伤严重程度（原文第 27 页）：GCS >= 13 提示轻度损伤；GCS 9-12 提示中度损伤；GCS <= 8 定义为重度创伤性脑损伤。",
      "原文档中没有 GCS 详细评分表；此处按标准 Glasgow Coma Scale 4/5/6 结构给出，属补充参考内容。",
      "总分范围 3-15 分（睁眼 1-4 + 言语 1-5 + 运动 1-6）。"
    ]
